# 4. UI vs upload engine

ORP UI NO debe hacer internamente:

```js
fetch(...)
axios.post(...)
XMLHttpRequest(...)
```

para subir archivos.

Tampoco debe conocer:

```text
/api/upload
/storage
S3
Cloudflare R2
Laravel
AWS
DigitalOcean Spaces
```

---

# 5. Data flow

Patrón esperado:

```text
User selects File
        ↓
ORP emits File/File[]
        ↓
Application validates/prepares
        ↓
Application performs upload
        ↓
Application updates progress/state
        ↓
ORP renders progress/state
```

